    "headline": "Taiwan's Largest EV Charging Operator EVALUE Enters Indonesia, Opens Jakarta Office",
    "summary": "EVALUE, Taiwan's largest electric vehicle (EV) charging network operator, today announced the launch of its Jakarta subsidiary, marking its first overseas expansion. The company will also establish a technical service center in Jakarta, bringing Taiwan's proven charging technology and expertise directly to Indonesia's fast-growing EV market, as the country accelerates its national EV and green energy transition.",
